{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Basis","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.trace_magnusGen_realization_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.trace_magnusGen_realization_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L187-L203","doc":"**The cyclic trace of the Magnus-realised tower vanishes** — the exact\npositive-side witness of #4480's `cyclic_trace_kills_iterCommTower`.  The\nsurviving Milnor coefficient is off-diagonal (`E_{0,n+1}` with `n+1 ≠ 0`), so its\ndiagonal trace is `0`: the coefficient is nonzero *as an algebra element* while\nbeing *trace-invisible*. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.milnorMagnusCoeff_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.milnorMagnusCoeff_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L176-L183","doc":"**The length-A Milnor/Magnus coefficient is nonzero for every `A ≥ 2`.**  The\nhonest sub-target *\"leading coefficient ≠ 0\"* at the Magnus level — the\ntopological content `μ̄(12…A) = ±1 ≠ 0`.  (Does **not** discharge\n`MilnorExactOrderConjecture`; see the module docstring.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.milnorMagnusCoeff_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.milnorMagnusCoeff_eq","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L169-L174","doc":"**★ The length-A Milnor/Magnus coefficient equals `(−1)ⁿ = ±1`.**  Derived\n(not fitted) from the closed-form tower computation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.milnorMagnusCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.milnorMagnusCoeff","kind":"def","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L161-L167","doc":"The **length-`(n+2)` Milnor/Magnus coefficient**: the `(0, n+1)` matrix\ncoordinate of the Magnus-realised tower — the coefficient of the top Magnus\nmonomial in the length-`(n+2)` iterated commutator.  This is Milnor's\nμ̄(12…(n+2)); it is a **non-cyclic** linear coordinate functional (contrast the\ncyclic Markov trace). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower_magnusGen_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower_magnusGen_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L146-L157","doc":"The tower on Magnus generators is **nonzero**: the length-`(n+2)` Milnor\ncommutator does not degenerate (needs `1 ≠ 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower_magnusGen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower_magnusGen","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L114-L144","doc":"**★ The tower on Magnus generators is `(−1)ⁿ · E_{0, n+1}`.**  A closed-form\nmatrix computation: the left-normed Lie iterated commutator of the elementary\nmatrices `E_{i,i+1}` telescopes to a single off-diagonal elementary matrix, with\nsign `(−1)ⁿ`.  This is the concrete Magnus realisation of the length-`(n+2)`\nMilnor invariant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.magnusGen_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.magnusGen_apply","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L110-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.magnusGen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.magnusGen","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L103-L108","doc":"**Magnus generators** in `Mₙ(R)`: `magnusGen N i = E_{i, i+1}` (the\nelementary matrix `single ⟨i⟩ ⟨i+1⟩ 1`) when `i+1 < N`, else `0`.  These realise\nthe free 2-step-nilpotent / faithful strictly-upper-triangular representation\nunderlying Milnor's Magnus expansion `x_i ↦ 1 + X_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower_succ","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L91-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MilnorMagnusCoefficient.iterCommTower","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MilnorMagnusCoefficient.lean#L85-L89","doc":"**Left-normed iterated commutator tower** (restated from #4471).\n`V 0 = c 0`; `V (n+1) = [c (n+1), V n] = c(n+1)·V n − V n·c(n+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}